        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biomethane, burned in industrial furnace 1MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biomethane, burned in industrial furnace 1MW
Inventory for 1 MJ biomethane, burned in an industrial furnace with a capacity of 1 MW with 5000 operating hours;
Synonyms: Biogas, aufbereitet, in Industriefeuerung 1MW; 
UUID: 1bae11e2-c22b-3038-849d-4ff1dda273c3
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (furnace), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: This inventory is based on the natural gas, burned in boiler inventory and adjusted regarding the biomethane input and the biogenic CO, CO2 and CH4 emissions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1bae11e2-c22b-3038-849d-4ff1dda273c3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
